---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Sleep Moore Support" description="Help and contact for the Sleep Moore app.">
<section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><p class="eyebrow">Sleep Moore</p><h1>Support</h1><p>We read every message and usually reply within two days.</p></div></section>
<div class="wrap"><div class="prose">
  <p>Email <a href="mailto:hello@sleepmoore.app">hello@sleepmoore.app</a>. If something went wrong, tell us your phone model and what you were doing, and we will look into it.</p>
  <h2>Common questions</h2>
  <dl>
    <dt>Do I need an account?</dt>
    <dd>No. There is nothing to sign up for. Everything you set up stays on your phone.</dd>
    <dt>Will the sounds keep playing with the screen locked?</dt>
    <dd>Yes. Sounds play in the background, and you can pause them from the lock screen.</dd>
    <dt>The gentle wake alarm did not sound.</dt>
    <dd>Leave a world playing with "Play until", and keep notifications on for Sleep Moore so a backup chime can sound if the app was closed. Check that the ringer is not on silent.</dd>
    <dt>How do I delete my data?</dt>
    <dd>Delete the app. Everything it stored is on your phone and goes with it. See the <a href="/privacy/">privacy policy</a> for details.</dd>
  </dl>
</div></div>
</Base>
